- tree.go exposes internal node positions.
- parse_errors.go keeps positions for recorded errors.
- parser_expression_actions.go and parser_engine_actions.go attach existing structured positions to translated errors.
- operator_stack.go positions its rejections at the first block their message cites.
- lexer/lexer.go exposes its source byte ranges, and generated/sany/sany.go exposes per-editor coordinate snapshots.
The other copied files change only in their imports; that includes proof.go and the parserrt files.
